  "prefLabel": "Geo 105.02 Quorum",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Geo 105.02 Quorum. A quorum of the board shall consist of not less than 3 members and a majority vote by the members present shall be necessary to pass a motion unless otherwise specified by law. In the absence of the chair, vice chair, or secretary, the chair shall designate a pro tempore officer for the officer or officers absent.\n\nSource. #7524, eff 7-1-01",
